"c" is a process [role: composite, type: c].
"c" zooms into "c body" and "c body.a", in that sequence, as well as "c body.a out".
"c body" is a process [role: node, type: t, path: body].
"c body" yields "c out".
"c body" requires "c body.a out" [arg: a, arg_index: 0].
"c body.a" is a process [role: node, type: t, path: body.a].
"c body.a" yields "c body.a out".
"c body.a out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: intermediate].
"c out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].
